     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHello distance list!</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nAnnouncing the new release of the distance sampling survey design package (dssd 0.3.0) on CRAN.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nMain new features:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span>Improved plotting via ggplot2.</span></li><li style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nFunction to aid the calculation of how much effort is required in the main survey given the pilot survey data to achieve a desired coefficient of variation. This is based on the equations in Section 2.4.2 of &#39;Distance Sampling: Methods and Applications&#39;. After\r\n installing type ?calculate.effort for details on how to use.<br>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nA full list of enhancements / fixes can be found at:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dssd/NEWS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dssd/NEWS&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472790763000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2sWL8IQJmGu8j2h16dufnP\">https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/dssd/NEWS</a><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest wishes,</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size:12pt;color:#000000;font-family:Calibri,Helvetica,sans-serif\">\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Distance Development Team<br>\r\n</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">Centre for Research into Ecological &amp; Environmental Modelling</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\">University of St. Andrews</p>\r\n<span></span><br>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px\"></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
